<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Tufang</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Tufang were a people living to the north or north-west of the Shang state, probably in present-day <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/shanxi">Shanxi</a>. Oracle-bone inscriptions from the reign of King <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/wu-ding">Wu Ding</a> often record their raids on Shang settlements and the king's campaigns against them, alongside wars with the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/guifang">Guifang</a> and the Qiang.</p></div>
